OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fsoon fading out to leave a dry evening
OL,7,Fwith some bright spells. Clouding over
OL,8,Fin the east overnight, with some
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain for Easter Ross and
OL,10,FCaithness developing in the early
OL,11,Fhours.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FRain in the east, perhaps
OL,14,Fturning heavy at times before
OL,15,Fgradually easing through the afternoon
OL,16,Fand evening. Generally drier but quite
OL,17,Fcloudy in the west. Occasionally
OL,18,Fbreezy around the coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
