OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRain
OL,6,Fand fresh winds clearing early
OL,7,FSaturday. Then rain or showers at
OL,8,Ftimes, occasionally heavy, along with
OL,9,Fsome drier and brighter spells. Winds
OL,10,Fwill be mostly light, freshening on
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
